  Source:  https://github.com/hikarioyama/dsv4-flash-nvfp4-sm120
  Licence: MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 hikari (kept in LICENSE)
  Covers:  the README above its Credits and Variants sections, docs/, serve.sh, serve-mtp.sh,
           serve_b12x_tp2.sh, b12x_inner.sh, mtp_*.sh, mtp_stream.py, run_mtp_on.sh, run_mtp_off.sh,
           bench_mtp.py, bench_throughput.sh, ready.sh, smoke.sh, stop.sh, and the changes in
           patches/nvfp4.py and patches/quant_config.py.

DSpark serving script
  Author:  Fraser Price (huggingface.co/fraserprice, x.com/fraserpricee)
  Source:  run.sh in https://huggingface.co/fraserprice/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-DSpark
  Licence: MIT, as published with that repository
  Covers:  fraserprice_run.sh (unchanged). The four fraserprice_*_*.sh variants are modified copies.

